 "not_collected": {
  "OpenStreetMap extracts": "about 30 GB, beyond a one-off job; services come from the GISCO healthcare and education datasets instead",
  "E-OBS climate grids": "licence restricts commercial use (the site carries ads)",
  "VIIRS night lights": "the annual files need a login",
  "Denmark municipal prices": "paid access",
  "ESHM20, GHSL 1975-2030 series, ESTV latest scenarios, STATPOP, Eurostat annual LAU": "no confirmed direct no-login file yet",
  "JRC flood depth, Natura 2000, ESA WorldCover": "multi-gigabyte rasters or tiles; a later, separate intake"
